{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge countless shots, unleash your spaceship's destructive power, and annihilate wave after wave of hostile aliens in the explosive vertical-scrolling shoot 'em up that is Truxton Extreme! This demo version includes a limited set of features to give you a good feel for Truxton Extreme ahead of its full release. (It also lets you face off against an iconic boss returning from the original game...) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo consists of four parts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TUTORIAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn the basics of the game and how its various mechanics work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main way to enjoy Truxton Extreme. Here, you'll see parts of the game's manga and meet Ash, one of the three main characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642820/extras/truxton_comic2.gif?t=1749487724\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ARCADE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The old-school way of gaming. No fuss. No nonsense. Just blast away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642820/extras/TXE3B.gif?t=1749487724\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HEART STARTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A more accessible game mode where you respawn if (when!) you die. Essentially, the game's Easy Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've got more to show before Truxton Extreme launches. Until then, you're very welcome to join our Discord channel, where you can discuss Truxton (and other shoot 'em ups) with fellow retro enthusiasts. Hope to see you there!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642820?t=1749487724","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642820/25e8c635d567d90e247f634529831fa5d7fd57df/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749487724","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642820/f15845ff1d514afa657f10dd99e4aa6776435bac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749487724","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642820/f15845ff1d514afa657f10dd99e4aa6776435bac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749487724","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge countless shots, unleash your spaceship's destructive power, and annihilate wave after wave of hostile aliens in the explosive vertical-scrolling shoot 'em up that is Truxton Extreme! This demo version includes a limited set of features to give you a good feel for Truxton Extreme ahead of its full release. (It also lets you face off against an iconic boss returning from the original game...) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo consists of four parts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TUTORIAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn the basics of the game and how its various mechanics work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main way to enjoy Truxton Extreme. Here, you'll see parts of the game's manga and meet Ash, one of the three main characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642820/extras/truxton_comic2.gif?t=1749487724\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ARCADE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The old-school way of gaming. No fuss. No nonsense. Just blast away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642820/extras/TXE3B.gif?t=1749487724\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HEART STARTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A more accessible game mode where you respawn if (when!) you die. Essentially, the game's Easy Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've got more to show before Truxton Extreme launches. Until then, you're very welcome to join our Discord channel, where you can discuss Truxton (and other shoot 'em ups) with fellow retro enthusiasts. Hope to see you there!</p>","developers":["Tatsujin Co., Ltd"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3323490","name":"Truxton Extreme"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642820/17dcd4a0e8d2bc462faa734fce1aa27ab184f8a5/header.jpg?t=1749487724","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 TATSUJIN Co., Ltd. \u00a9 Published by Clear River Games. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152119,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152119/movie480.mp4?t=1749487453","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152119/movie_max.mp4?t=1749487453"},"name":"Announcement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152119/f4539f8cdd45e1a39b5b1d873907bef0a5ce1798/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749487453","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152119/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749487453","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152119/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749487453"}}],"name":"Truxton Extreme Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><str